  "privacyPolicyTitle": "PRIVACY POLICY",
  "platformName": "\"Fali nam igrač\" Platform",
  "introduction": "Introductory remarks",
  "privacyPolicyDescription1": "This document represents the official Privacy Policy for the website located at ",
  "privacyPolicyDescription2": " and the application available on Google Play at ",
  "privacyPolicyDescription3": " and on iOS at ",
  "privacyPolicyDescription4": " (hereinafter: \"Platform\").",
  "legalBasis": "In accordance with the Personal Data Protection Act (\"Official Gazette of RS\" No. 87/2018), the owner of the Platform, the business entity Nikola Garabandić PR Harpoon games Novi Sad, registration number: 66391566, hereby adopts this Privacy Policy.",
  "policyAgreement": "This Privacy Policy constitutes an agreement, specifically an adhesion contract, since the website user has the opportunity to accept or decline this Policy. If the user declines this Privacy Policy, they will not be granted access to certain features of the site.",
  "registrationRequirement": "By registering a personal account on the Platform, the user must accept this document as one of the conditions for creating an account, which is a prerequisite for using the services of the Platform.",
  "contractConclusion": "This agreement is concluded between the owner of the Platform and the user of the Platform at the time of account registration on the Platform.",
  "acceptanceAction": "The Privacy Policy is accepted by the user’s affirmative action, confirming that they have read and understood this Privacy Policy.",
  "subjectMatter": "Subject matter",
  "policyObjective1": "The Privacy Policy is a document that aims to establish the scope, method, purpose, and legal basis for data processing on the 'Fali nam igrač' Platform (website: ",
  "policyObjective2": " application: ",
  "policyObjective3": " and iOS application: ",
  "policyObjective4": " ).",
  "dataCollection": "Data we collect through the website",
  "collectedData": "Through the Platform, when creating a registered user profile, the owner of the Platform collects the following data:",
  "dataListEmail": "1. The user's email address;",
  "dataListPasswordHash": "2. The hashed password (for security reasons, the original password is not stored in its raw form);",
  "dataListLocation": "3. Location;",
  "dataListFullName": "4. User’s first and last name;",
  "dataListBirthDate": "5. Date of birth;",
  "dataListGender": "6. Gender;",
  "dataListPhoto": "7. Photo (optional).",
  "purposeOfCollection": "Purpose of data collection",
  "primaryPurpose": "The purpose of collecting all data from Article 2, paragraph 1 is to open (register) an account, i.e., provide the possibility of accessing the part of the Platform that is available only to registered users, i.e., using the Platform in line with its purpose, in accordance with the Platform’s Terms of Service.",
  "secondaryPurpose": "A secondary purpose and logic for collecting the data from Article 2, paragraph 1, item 3 is to enable the user to achieve the purpose of account creation—namely, to receive local sports game suggestions in their city or nearby so they can potentially decide to participate, or if they are an organizer, to advertise games and be connected with potential participants. This is crucial because sports games are locally based and happen in a physical location.",
  "secondaryPurposeSorting": "A secondary purpose and logic for collecting the data from Article 2, paragraph 1, items 5 and 6 is for the Platform to more effectively sort which games are available to the user.",
  "legalBasisForCollection": "Legal basis for data collection",
  "legalBasisDescription": "The legal basis for collecting the data from Article 2, paragraph 1, items 1-7 is the conclusion of the contract titled “Platform Terms of Service” upon registering an account, for the purpose of using the information society services provided by the owner of the Platform.",
  "dataProtection": "Data protection",
  "dataProtectionDescription": "The collected data is stored electronically in databases accessed by a limited number of individuals in the legal entity that owns the Platform. The system is protected by antivirus software. The hosting company is obliged to treat any personal data it encounters in relation to the Platform in the same way the Platform owner does.",
  "dataRiskNotification": "In the event of a major threat to or compromise of data, such as a data leak, hacking attack, or theft of databases, the owner of the Platform will notify the Commissioner for Information of Public Importance and Personal Data Protection.",
  "dataBreachResponse": "If there is suspicion of unauthorized access to the computing devices owned by the Platform owner, passwords will be changed as soon as possible, and other necessary measures will be taken to prevent future compromises of data security.",
  "dataRetention": "Data retention period",
  "dataRetentionDescription": "Personal data will not be retained longer than necessary to achieve the purpose for which it was processed. If the retention period is stipulated by law, the owner of the Platform will retain the data for that statutory period. After the purpose is fulfilled or the legally prescribed retention period expires, the data will be permanently deleted. Thus, data is kept as long as the Platform Terms of Service are in force between the Platform owner and the user, i.e., until the user closes (deletes) their account.",
  "extendedDataRetention": "In certain cases, personal data may be retained for a longer period to fulfill legal obligations or for the establishment, exercise, or defense of legal claims, in accordance with applicable laws.",
  "dataDeletionRequest": "Any individual may request the deletion of their data at any time, understanding that this entails deletion of the user’s account, thus prohibiting further access to the site until a new account is created.",
  "backlinks": "Backlinks",
  "backlinksDescription": "This Platform may contain links to other websites not under the control of the Platform owner and not subject to this Privacy Policy. If users follow these links to other sites, the operators of those sites may request information from them, which they will use in accordance with their own privacy policies, which may differ from this Privacy Policy.",
  "cookies": "Cookies",
  "cookiesDescription": "The Platform uses cookies to improve the user experience. A notice about this appears for new users upon their first visit to the site, and they can accept by actively agreeing to the Cookie Policy applicable to this Platform.",
  "automatedDecisionMaking": "Automated decision-making and profiling",
  "automatedDecisionMakingDescription": "The Platform owner does not make decisions or engage in profiling in an automated manner.",
  "dataSubjectRights": "Rights of data subjects",
  "dataSubjectRightsDescription": "Individuals whose data is processed via the site have the following personal data protection rights:",
  "rightToInformation": "- Right to information - Employees and other data subjects have the right to be informed about their rights, obligations, and issues related to the processing of their personal data, in accordance with the law, even before processing begins.",
  "rightToAccess": "- Right of access - Employees and other data subjects have the right to request from the Platform owner access to their personal data, i.e., to find out the subject, method, purpose, and scope of the processing, as well as to pose questions about that processing.",
  "rightToRectification": "- Right to rectification and completion - After exercising the right of access, data subjects have the right to request the owner of the Platform to correct, supplement, or update the processed personal data.",
  "rightToErasure": "- Right to erasure - Data subjects may request the Platform owner to erase their personal data in accordance with the law, as well as to discontinue or temporarily suspend processing.",
  "rightToWithdrawConsent": "- Right to withdraw consent to processing - Where the legal basis for data processing is the data subject’s consent, that individual may withdraw consent at any time, in writing.",
  "rightToRestrictProcessing": "- Right to restriction of processing - Under the law, data subjects have the right to request that the data controller restrict the processing of their personal data.",
  "rightToDataPortability": "- Right to data portability - Data subjects may request the transfer of their personal data to another controller, where technically feasible, if the data in question is in a structured and machine-readable format.",
  "rightToObject": "- Right to object and automated individual decision-making - If the data subject deems it justified given their particular situation, they have the right at any time to object to the processing of their data, as well as to not be subject to a decision made solely on the basis of automated processing, including profiling, where such a decision produces legal effects concerning them or significantly affects their position.",
  "rightToObjectMarketing": "The data subject has the right to object to the processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes and to request that processing be restricted in other cases.",
  "dataProcessingForNewPurpose": "If the controller intends to further process personal data for a purpose different from that for which the data was collected, the controller must, prior to that processing, provide the data subject with information about the new purpose and all relevant details in accordance with the right to information of the data subject.",
  "dataTransfer": "Transfer of data to third parties",
  "dataTransferDescription": "The Platform owner does not transfer data to third parties in the country or abroad without the explicit consent of the data subject, except in exceptional, legally prescribed cases where no consent is required. Personal data will be submitted to public authorities only where required by law.",
  "dataTransferInCaseOfSale": "In the event of the sale of the business entity that owns the Platform, the databases and the Platform will become the property of the buyer, who will be bound by all contracts previously signed by the legal entity that owns the Platform with its users, which includes these Terms of Service and this Privacy Policy.",
  "dataProtectionMechanisms": "Personal data protection mechanisms",
  "dataProtectionMechanismsDescription": "Any person who believes their data has been compromised or is at risk may use internal and external mechanisms. Internally, they can file a complaint with the Platform owner; externally, they can seek protection from the competent government authority.",
  "competentAuthority": "Competent authority",
  "competentAuthorityDescription": "The competent authority for data protection in the Republic of Serbia is the Commissioner for Information of Public Importance and Personal Data Protection, located at Bulevar kralja Aleksandra 15, 11000 Belgrade, Serbia, email: office@poverenik.rs, phone: +381 11 3408 900.",
  "policyChanges": "Changes to the Privacy Policy",
  "policyChangesDescription": "The Platform owner reserves the right to amend this Privacy Policy at any time, and all amendments take effect on the day they are published. You will be duly informed of any substantial changes.",
