  "termsGeneralPart1": "These Terms of Use govern the rights and obligations regarding the use of the website located at ",
  "termsGeneralPart2": " and the application available on Google Play at ",
  "termsGeneralPart3": " and on iOS at ",
  "termsGeneralPart4": " (hereinafter: \"Platform\").",
  "termsGeneral2": "These Terms of Service constitute the legal framework of the Platform and the rules that apply while users interact with it.",
  "termsGeneral3": "By its nature, these Terms of Service are an electronic contract—an adhesion contract—whose provisions the user cannot influence but may only accept as stated by the Platform owner.",
  "termsGeneral4": "The Terms of Service represent a contract for the provision of information society services, concluded by the meeting of wills between:",
  "termsGeneral5": "1. The Platform owner, i.e., the service provider;",
  "termsGeneral6": "2. The registered user of the Platform, i.e., the service user, at the time of account creation on the Platform.",
  "termsGeneral7": "The Platform owner’s consent is reflected in publicly posting these Terms of Service, while each individual user’s consent is given in the designated place on the Platform.",
  "termsGeneral8": "The purpose of the Platform is to connect users in order to hold sports games of various types, fostering a sporting spirit, healthy living, social inclusion, and a culture of sports.",
  "termsDefinitionsPart1": "Platform – the software named 'Fali nam igrač', represented through the website at: ",
  "termsDefinitionsPart2": " and the application available on Google Play at: ",
  "termsDefinitionsPart3": " and the iOS application at: ",
  "termsDefinitionsPart4": ".",
  "termsDefinitions2": "Platform owner – The Platform and domain are owned by Nikola Garabandić PR Harpoon games Novi Sad, ID: 66391566.",
  "termsDefinitions3": "Platform user – any individual who accesses the Platform and thus uses it, regardless of whether they perform any specific actions.",
  "termsDefinitions4": "Registered user of the Platform – any individual who has created an account on the Platform, thereby concluding this agreement. Such a person is a contracting party to this agreement.",
  "termsDefinitions5": "Platform service – The Platform provides the following services:\n\t- Mediating the search for teammates for various sports near the chosen location.",
  "termsDefinitions6": "Platform functions – All functions besides an informational function:\n\t- The function of registering a profile;\n\t- The function of advertising a game and responding to it;\n\t- The function of chat between registered members;\n\t- The function of using location services.",
  "termsIntro": "Everyone is guaranteed open access to the Platform. However, not everyone has access to all its sections. Certain actions require a registered account—i.e., becoming a registered user. Anyone can become a registered user simply by signing up.",
  "termsIntro2": "Use of the Platform is available to natural persons solely in the manner and under the conditions described in these Terms of Service, i.e., according to the rules for providing information society services.",
  "termsIntro3": "The integrity of the Platform implies that the Platform owner may alter or discontinue (temporarily or permanently) any element of the Platform, the services provided, or any content and listings related to those elements.",
  "termsContract": "The subject of this agreement comprises the conditions under which individuals may access and use the Platform and its services, as well as the relationships between the Platform owner and users and, specifically, between the owner and registered users, along with the service provided.",
  "termsContract2": "The goal of the Platform is to enable users to find others who are willing to join sports activities requiring a certain number of participants, in accordance with the Platform’s purpose.",
  "termsFunctioning": "Users of the Platform may choose to create an account and thus become registered users, enabling them to access the Platform’s functions and services.",
  "termsFunctioning2": "Users open an account by completing the registration form on the site and actively accepting these Terms of Service and the Privacy Policy. Upon acceptance, the user electronically concludes a contract with the Platform owner. After registration, the user must verify their account through the email used during registration.\n\nThese Terms of Service govern each individual instance of accessing the Platform.\n\nRegistered users may collect information and use the services provided by the Platform.",
  "termsFunctioning3": "Operation of the Platform is primarily regulated by the Law on Electronic Commerce, the Law on Obligations, the Law on Advertising, the Law on Copyright and Related Rights, the Law on Trademarks, the Law on Personal Data Protection, and other applicable legislation of the Republic of Serbia where these laws do not apply. The Platform is dedicated to upholding personal data protection rights for individuals and intellectual property rights, in accordance with professional IT standards, good business practices, and Serbian law.",
  "termsOwnerObligations": "The Platform owner ensures the functionality of the Platform, thereby allowing users to utilize it.",
  "termsOwnerObligations2": "The Platform owner is obliged to respect these Terms of Service and user privacy.",
  "termsUserObligations": "A registered user must utilize the Platform in accordance with its stated purpose and in line with these Terms of Service, which they have accepted.",
  "termsUserObligations2": "A registered user of the Platform is responsible for maintaining the data related to their account and password, limiting access to their device, and accepting liability for any actions taken under their account, especially regarding game announcements.",
  "termsFees": "A registered user is not obligated to pay any fees for using the Platform; usage is free of charge.",
  "termsFees2": "The provision in paragraph 1 of this article applies initially; however, in the future, the Platform owner may introduce a fee at any time in accordance with their business policy. Users will be informed of any such change at least 15 days before it takes effect.",
  "termsAdvertising": "The main function of the Platform is to show users various sports games they can join.\n\nA user can advertise a sports game by specifying its category, location, and time. Likewise, a user may apply to a game created by another user.\n\nEach user who posts a game is fully responsible for its content, ensuring no rights are infringed and refraining from hate speech, violence, or illegal conduct. The Platform is not responsible for content created by users.\n\nAnyone who observes content violating the above may report it to the Platform owner, who will remove it within 48 hours.\n\nThe Platform owner does not organize these games; the owner merely provides a space for organizers to advertise them. Hence, the owner is not responsible for occurrences during the game or for participants’ behavior.",
  "termsCommunication": "The Platform allows registered users to communicate via chat, mainly regarding the scheduled sports game.\n\nUsers must not misuse this communication channel or infringe on others’ rights, threaten, extort, breach personal data rights, or engage in any action that is unlawful.\n\nThe Platform owner is not liable for the actions of users in their mutual communication. However, any user can report another user for harassment, hate speech, threats, or discrimination; the Platform owner will act on such reports within 48 hours.",
  "termsPrivacy": "The Platform ensures personal data protection in accordance with the Law on Personal Data Protection.\n\nTo open an account and become a registered user of the Platform, one must actively accept this Privacy Policy as a separate document in addition to these Terms of Service.",
  "termsNonDiscrimination": "The Platform allows any interested individual to use its service, create an account, and enjoy the offerings without direct or indirect discrimination based on race, sex, nationality, social origin, birth, religion, political or other beliefs, property status, culture, language, age, or mental/physical disability.",
  "termsLiability": "The Platform owner is not responsible for the accuracy of information provided by users. The owner bears no legal or material liability. The Platform’s role is purely informational, allowing users to post and coordinate sports games with other users.\n\nThe Platform does not substitute for professional consulting or any other services beyond those explicitly described herein.",
  "termsTermination": "This contract is concluded for an indefinite period.\n\nIt may be terminated unilaterally by the user deleting their profile, after which they lose access to any part of the Platform available only to registered users.\n\nThe Platform owner reserves the right, at its discretion, to delete any account presumed to be false or not in compliance with these Terms of Service, without providing specific reasoning. Deletion constitutes termination of this contract by the owner’s unilateral decision.",
  "termsModification": "The Platform owner may modify these Terms of Service at any time. This does not result in a new contract being concluded but rather offers a revised version to all registered users. Substantial changes require renewed acceptance by the users; technical changes do not.\n\nUsers will be informed of these modifications through a notification displayed upon their next login before they can perform any action on the Platform. If they choose not to accept the revised Terms, it is as though they never accepted the Terms initially, and their accounts will be frozen until acceptance.",
  "termsJurisdiction": "In the event of any dispute arising under this contract between the Platform owner and the user, the court in Novi Sad, Serbia, shall have jurisdiction.",
